# Pairs with BulkHintBound. Review B1 of #5646 (take before deliver): copy,
# deliver, drop. Dropping before the delivery loses the rows.
MODULE: BulkHintBoundDropBeforeDeliver
TARGET: BulkHintBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the old leaf drops the rows it handed back before they are delivered
PERTURBS: Drop

--- FIND
    /\ phase = "delivered"
    /\ rowsO' = rowsO \ copied
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: drop before delivery.
    /\ phase \in {"narrowed", "delivered"}
    /\ rowsO' = rowsO \ copied
--- END
